    "abstract": "Illustrated parts breakdown of one cargo door latching station, showing the latching rib, the intercostal, the sensor bracket plate and the cover hardware, common to the forward, aft and bulk doors.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure gives the parts breakdown of one cargo door latching station. Use it to order sensor bracket plates, latching intercostals and the cover hardware for any of the three cargo doors.",
      "figure_note": "The figure shows one station in section, and the station is repeated six times on each door. Item 10 is the sensor bracket plate, item 20 the standoff shim pack built at rigging and item 30 the sensor retaining pins. One of each is fitted per station. The forward, aft and bulk doors use the same station parts."
    },
